# Sibling clone: ../../cocode-harness (https://github.com/cocode-agency/cocode-harness)
# Build it first: cd ../../cocode-harness && pnpm install && pnpm run build
# Packaged CLI: set this to the built Harness checkout instead of using a sibling path.
# COCODE_HARNESS_ROOT=../../cocode-harness
# The Cocode-owned runner loads companion/cordis.yml and uses the sibling Harness packages.
# Copy to .env and uncomment:
# COCODE_HARNESS_CMD=node
# COCODE_HARNESS_ARGS=--import,tsx/esm,scripts/companion-runner.mjs
# DSH_CORDIS_CONFIG=companion/cordis.yml
# Debug the Cocode account home in this repo. Do not put API keys in .env.
# COCODE_HOME=.dev/home
# Keep DSH settings, credentials, and sessions isolated from ~/.dsh when needed.
# DSH_HOME=.dev/dsh
# DSH_SESSION_ROOT=.dev/dsh/sessions
# Optional launch overrides (these mask settings.yaml if set):
# COCODE_PROVIDER=deepseek-official
# COCODE_MODEL=deepseek-v4-flash
# COCODE_AGENCY_ORIGIN=https://cocode.agency
# Error language: zh or en. Unset → LANG / LC_MESSAGES.
# COCODE_LANG=zh
# Terminal surface: inline preserves scrollback; alternate uses the fullscreen buffer.
# COCODE_TUI_SCREEN=inline
# Vision bridge: choose cocode or user. Cocode reuses the account cloud route by default.
# COCODE_VISION_PROVIDER=cocode
# COCODE_VISION_ENDPOINT=https://vision.example/v1/chat/completions
# COCODE_VISION_USER_ENDPOINT=https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions
# COCODE_VISION_USER_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
# COCODE_VISION_USER_CREDENTIAL_REF=OPENAI_API_KEY
# COCODE_VISION_CREDENTIAL_REF=COCODE_CLOUD_API_KEY
